      "localizedDescription": "AirStore is a SideStore fork. Apple ID sign-in no longer ends in -80045 on iOS 26.4 and above: the client identity sent to Apple now matches the Anisette server that mints the headers, single-use X-Apple-I-MD is refreshed at every step, and the default server is one backed by a real Windows ADI.\n\nVerified on one iPhone on iOS 27.2 with a free personal Apple ID. Installing and refreshing third-party apps after sign-in has not been re-tested. Sign-in depends on the third-party server win.ani.sidestore.io staying online.",
